  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Electronic configuration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>Ar</mi><mo>]</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/e4b105c2-28c7-4742-ac7e-a200f29b22d6-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 78px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> are strong field ligands</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/6019f557-2bcb-415a-bcc6-8620cc2a7d96-image.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 58px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> hybridisation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math> is a strong ligand and from six coordinate&nbsp;bonds with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Fe</mi><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> . Thus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Fe</mi></math> show <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> hybridisation in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>Fe</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>CN</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>6</mn></msub></math>.</p>",
